# Keep the host's installed node_modules (and VCS/build cruft) out of the apps/user build context.
# Paths are relative to the build context (the treetracker-wallet-app monorepo root). BuildKit reads
# this dockerfile-specific ignore file (<dockerfile>.dockerignore) in preference to a context-root one.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
